$ oc explain caches.spec --recursive
GROUP:      infinispan.org
KIND:       Cache
VERSION:    v2alpha1

FIELD: spec <Object>


DESCRIPTION:
    CacheSpec defines the desired state of Cache
    
FIELDS:
  adminAuth	<Object>
    password	<Object>
      key	<string> -required-
      name	<string>
      optional	<boolean>
    secretName	<string>
    username	<Object>
      key	<string> -required-
      name	<string>
      optional	<boolean>
  clusterName	<string> -required-
  name	<string>
  template	<string>
  templateName	<string>
  updates	<Object>
    strategy	<string>
    enum: recreate, retain
